OTHER polygcd  : number,number >> number  ATT SYMBOLIC polygcd
OTHER polygcd  : real,real,real >> real   ATT SYMBOLIC polygcd    # Rubi PolyGCD[p,q,x]
OTHER polygcd  : number,number,number >> number ATT SYMBOLIC polygcd
